#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:102
msgid "Link metadata timeout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:104
msgid ""
"Adds a configurable timeout for requests made to return link metadata. If"
" the metadata is not returned before this timeout expires, the message "
"will post without requiring metadata. This timeout covers the failure "
"cases of broken URLs and bad content types on slow network connections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:107
msgid ""
"This feature's ``config.json`` setting is "
"``\"LinkMetadataTimeoutMilliseconds``: 5000`` with numerical input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:118
msgid "Email batching buffer size"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:120
msgid "Specify the maximum number of notifications batched into a single email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:124
msgid ""
"We recommend increasing the buffer size from the default value if you see"
" the following error in the Mattermost logs: ``Email batching job's "
"receiving buffer was full. Please increase the EmailBatchingBufferSize. "
"Falling back to sending immediate mail.`` Increasing this value will "
"ensure emails are queued up, without impacting server performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:125
msgid ""
"Notifications will be sent instantly if the queue of emails exceeds the "
"`email batching interval <#id1>`_ configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:128
msgid ""
"This feature's ``config.json`` setting is ``EmailBatchingBufferSize``: "
"256`` with numerical input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:139
msgid "Email batching interval"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:141
msgid ""
"Specify the maximum frequency, in seconds, which the batching job checks "
"for new notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:145
msgid ""
"We recommend decreasing the email batching interval from the default "
"value if you see the following error in the Mattermost logs: ``Email "
"batching job's receiving buffer was full. Please increase the "
"EmailBatchingBufferSize. Falling back to sending immediate mail.``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:146
msgid "Longer batching intervals may increase performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:147
msgid ""
"Notifications will be sent instantly if the `queue of emails <#email-"
"batching-buffer-size>`_ exceeds the email batching interval configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-settings.rst:150
msgid ""
"This feature's ``config.json`` setting is ``EmailBatchingInterval\": 30``"
" with numerical input."
msgstr ""

